---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <p>Website built with cloud agents.</p>
    <p class="muted">AI is under-hyped. Our future is fantastic.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .footer-inner p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .muted {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
